# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# This project is developed across machines, and without this git rewrites text files to
# CRLF on Windows checkout — which shows up as whole-file diffs when the same file is
# touched on two platforms. Committing LF and checking out LF keeps diffs meaningful.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary and generated files git should not try to diff or normalise.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
